        "title": "Avowed",
        "extract": "Avowed is an action role-playing game developed by Obsidian Entertainment and published by Xbox Game Studios. The game is set in the world of Eora, the same universe as Pillars of Eternity. It was released for Windows and Xbox Series X/S on February 18, 2025, and for PlayStation 5 on February 17, 2026. The game received generally positive reviews from critics, but failed to meet the sales expectations of Xbox Game Studios.\n\n",
